OL,3,GNEWSABoys, 12 and 15, held over former
OL,4,Arestaurant fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo boys aged 12 and 15 have been
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of arson
OL,8,Ffollowing a large fire at a former
OL,9,Frestaurant.
OL,11,FMultiple fire crews were called out to
OL,12,Fthe blaze on Old Great North Road in
OL,13,FBrotherton, near Knottingley, at about
OL,14,F22:15 BST on Monday.
OL,16,FOfficers said no reports of any
OL,17,Finjuries or missing people had been
OL,18,Freceived but a full search of the
OL,19,Fproperty would be carried out once safe
OL,20,Fto do so.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
